          type        : CONFIG_CHECK
          description : "1.87 CISC-RT-000940"
          info        : "The Cisco Multicast Source Discovery Protocol (MSDP) switch must be configured to limit the amount of source-active messages it accepts on a per-peer basis.

GROUP ID: V-221068
RULE ID: SV-221068r622190

To reduce any risk of a denial-of-service (DoS) attack from a rogue or misconfigured MSDP switch, the switch must be configured to limit the number of source-active messages it accepts from each peer."
          solution    : "Configure the switch to limit the amount of source-active messages it accepts from each peer.

SW1(config)#ip msdp sa-limit x.1.28.2 nnn"
